					"content": "Sure.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230070306
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230070306,
					"content": "Thank you. And don't forget, we're looking for soil where Whopperflowers grow!",
